# T80 vote-devilbox (plan 2026-10-25-m3-library.md, Phase 6, I174). tests/net/vote_devilbox.cmake runs this against its
# own fixture server: VOTE 5 posts /api/hip/vote?k=<token>&m=<uade key>&r=5, a repeat is rate limited (ERR rate), VOTE
# with no argument reads /api/hip/votes, VOTE 0 withdraws. @votes prints vote_posts= status= count= yours= m=.
OPEN @SONGS@/ambient.mod
VOTE 5
@votes
VOTE 5
@votes
VOTE
@votes
VOTE 0
@votes
